          "title": "Towie",
          "subtitle": "Card Game",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Towie is a three-hand adaptation of bridge invented in Paris in 1931, with only three active players at a time."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Towie is documented as a distinct traditional card game with its own player count, equipment, and objective."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
