              "text": "3 or more players use the table arrangement described for Towie."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Standard 52-card pack"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Standard 52-card pack, score area, and enough table space for play."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Prepare Standard 52-card pack and deal or lay out cards according to the documented Towie rules before play begins."
